rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids has come in under 90% of normal in April to May 38 times in 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 172% of normal and November to December at 33%. So far in 2026 it shows January to February at 56% and May to June at 135%. Grid 20549 had its driest year in 1953 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
